# Changelog

All notable changes to the **Pet Adoption Explorer** project will be documented in this file.

The format is based on [Keep a Changelog](https://keepachangelog.com/en/1.1.0/), and this project follows Semantic Versioning.

---

## [v0.3.0] - Sprint 3: Data Analysis, Visualization & Advanced Features

**Period:** 25–29 September 2026  
**Status:** Completed

Sprint 3 focused on extending the Pet Adoption Explorer from a data presentation system into an analytical system capable of processing, analyzing, visualizing, filtering, sorting, and comparing pet adoption data.

### Added

- Added Data Processing and Data Normalization workflow for pet data.
- Added data preparation for pet adoption attributes (category, location, housing suitability, initial/monthly costs, and age).
- Added Exploratory Data Analysis (EDA) for pet records using Pandas.
- Added descriptive statistical analysis for pet maintenance costs and age distribution.
- Added summary statistics including count, mean, median, minimum, maximum, and standard deviation for monthly adoption expenses.
- Added pet category frequency and proportion analysis (Dogs, Cats, Rabbits, Rodents, Birds).
- Added housing suitability proportion analysis (Condo vs. House).
- Added Statistics Dashboard page.
- Added Data Visualizations using Altair for pet statistics.
- Added Category Distribution visualization.
- Added Monthly Cost Analysis by Category visualization.
- Added Suitable Housing Proportion visualization.
- Added Age Distribution visualization.
- Added Initial vs. Monthly Cost Comparison visualization.
- Added Advanced Filtering for Category, Location, Suitable Housing, and Max Monthly Cost.
- Added Advanced Sorting for Monthly Cost, Age, and Pet Name (ascending/descending).
- Added Advanced Pet Comparison functionality for comparing 2–3 pets side-by-side.
- Added empty-state handling for cases where no pet matches the selected filters.
- Added Sprint 3 statistical analysis test cases.
- Added Sprint 3 visualization and integration test coverage.

### Changed

- Updated the application workflow to include Data Processing and Analysis before displaying statistical results.
- Updated the Dashboard workflow to support Statistics and Altair Data Visualization.
- Updated pet filtering to support multi-condition filtering.
- Updated pet sorting to support multiple fields and directions.
- Updated the Dashboard to support side-by-side pet comparisons.
- Updated the project structure by adding `src/analysis/statistics.py` and `src/components/statistics_page.py`.
- Updated project documentation to reflect Sprint 3 implementation and completed features.

### Fixed

- Improved handling of missing or incomplete cost values during statistical calculations using numeric coercion.
- Improved handling of empty datasets after applying filters to display informative empty states without crashing.
- Fixed integration issues between processed DataFrame records and Altair chart components.

### Testing

Sprint 3 testing covered:

- Data Normalization
- Missing Values Handling
- Descriptive Statistics Calculation
- Category Frequency & Proportion Analysis
- Multi-condition Filtering
- Advanced Sorting
- Pet Comparison Table Rendering
- Empty Dataset Handling
- Statistics Page Rendering
- Integration Testing

