## [v0.1.0] - Sprint 1: Web Foundation & UI Prototype

**Period:** 10–15 September 2026  
**Status:** Completed

Sprint 1 established the initial application foundation and interactive Web UI prototype using Streamlit and a local sample dataset.

### Added

- Created Pet Adoption Explorer project.
- Added Top Navigation Bar with 7 main menus (Home, Explore, Compare, Match Quiz, Budget Calc, Favorites, Admin).
- Added Hero Banner and Pet of the Day highlight section.
- Added local sample pet dataset (Boba, Cookie, Milo, etc.).
- Added category filtering buttons.
- Added basic search component.
- Added basic pet comparison layout.
- Added Match Quiz UI flow.
- Added Budget Calculator UI layout.
- Added Favorites empty state handling.
- Added Sprint 1 QA test cases and daily task allocation.

### Changed

- Updated project documentation based on Sprint 1 requirements.
- Updated Project Pitch and Master Plan documents.
- Updated Learning Log and Change Log for Sprint 1.

